WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.970
كِتاب — book

2
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.020
مَدِينَة — city

3
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:03.910
صَدِيق — friend

4
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:05.730
You've tried to learn Arabic before.

5
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.220
A new script, tiny vowel marks, and words that slip away a week later.

6
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.230
You can recite it. But do you understand it?

7
00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:17.690
[Rafiq] Meet Rafiq, your companion in learning Arabic.

8
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:20.590
Can't read the script yet? Start with the letters.

9
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:24.620
Then one path, one Continue button, five to ten minutes a day.

10
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:29.170
Every word fully vowelled, and spoken by a native Arabic voice.

11
00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:30.420
بَيْت — house

12
00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.050
[Rafiq] Rafiq remembers what you've learned, and brings each word back just before you'd forget it.

13
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.470
السَّلامُ عَلَيْكُمْ. أَنا جارُكَ الْجَدِيدُ. — Peace be upon you. I'm your new neighbour.

14
00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:47.390
Then use it. Reply in your own words, and find out instantly if it makes sense.

15
00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:52.480
It notices the mistakes you keep making, and helps you fix them.

16
00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:57.250
A few minutes a day. Words that come back until they stay.

17
00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:59.610
[Rafiq] Try Rafiq free today.
